# Every version of each rtx-remix/ payload file that has shipped, one line per
# version: the SHA-256 of the file with CRLF line endings folded to LF, two
# spaces, and the file's path under the JAR's native/ root.
#
# NativeExtractor replaces a live payload file only when its hash appears here
# for that path, which proves the file is an untouched earlier default rather
# than someone's edit. Append a line whenever a payload file changes and never
# remove one: an install can still hold any version that ever shipped.
# NativeExtractorTest fails with the line to append when the current payload
# is missing from this list.

